1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:07,760
All these visitors mean we have had to expand our operation and it's now a truly family concern.
所有这些参观者意味着我们应该扩大运营范围，而且现在它成了一个家族企业。

2
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:16,220
I'm near to retirement age so I only concern myself with looking after the mechanical side of things - keeping the trains going.
我快到了退休的年龄，所以我只想照看机械方面的事情，维持火车的运行。

3
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:24,470
Liz now devotes all her energies to recruiting and supporting the large squadron of workers, which keep the place running smoothly.
莉兹将所有的精力用在招募和支持大量员工的身上，以保证这里的顺利运营。

4
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:30,600
We're really pleased that after some years away teaching, Sarah has now returned to the park
我们很高兴在莎拉教书几年之后回到了公园，

5
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:36,920
and makes sure the visitors are kept fed and watered, which keeps her pretty busy as you can imagine.
她的工作是确保参观者有食吃，有水喝，你可以想象这让她很忙。

6
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:44,060
Our son, Duncan, has been a stalwart of the park for the last ten years, taking over from me in the area of construction
我们的儿子，邓肯在过去的十年中是公园的中流砥柱，他在建设上接手了我的工作，

7
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:52,320
and I'll say a little bit more about that in a moment - and his new wife, Judith, has also joined the team in charge of retall.
我一会儿会就此多说一些，而且他的妻子朱迪思也加入了团队，负责零售。

8
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:58,340
That's becoming a tremendous growth area for us - a lot of people want to buy souvenirs.
这成了我们大幅增长的领域，许多人想要购买纪念品。

9
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:02,090
So have you finished your development of the site for the moment?
那么你们目前完成了发展场地的计划了吗？

10
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:07,110
Not at all!We're constantly looking for ways to offer more to our visitors.
完全没有！我们总是想办法为客人提供更多。

11
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:15,710
The railway remains the central feature and there's now 1.2 kilometres of the line laid but we'd like to lay more.
铁路仍然是主要的特色，现在有1.2公里的线路，但是我们想要拓展更多。

12
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:20,640
Because of the geology of the area, our greatest problem is digging tunnels.
由于这里的地质，我们最大的问题是挖掘隧道。

13
00:01:20,650 --> 00:01:22,900
But we're gradually overcoming that.
但是我们正在逐渐克服。

14
00:01:22,910 --> 00:01:30,540
We're also very pleased with a new installation of the Go-Kart arena which is 120 square metres in area.
我们还很高兴地安装了新的小型赛车区域，占地120平方米。

15
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:33,220
Again the problem is the geology;
这里依旧有地质问题，

16
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:37,140
we had to level the mounds on the track for safety reasons.
我们不得不考虑安全因素，使轨道上的土丘更平坦。

17
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:41,130
We wanted to enable 5-12year olds to use the go-karts.
我们希望能让5-12岁的小孩使用小型赛车。

18
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:44,990
And the main attraction here is the Formula 1 Kart.
这里最吸引人的是F1小型赛车。

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,860
We've known fights to break out over who gets it!
我们听说大家都抢破头去玩它！

20
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:55,490
And then finally to our most recent development which is the landscaped...
最后，我们最近的进展是……
